                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "What a game! I remember playing this back in the 90's and loving it. Coming back to it in 2026 still brings the same vibes. The UI is dated and a bit clunky, but the game is still so playable. Funny lines, colorful characters, well balanced dynamics. I wish they made a new version!\n\nTo make this work on Linux: (1) Delete WAIL32.DLL from the game folder (2) Run it on Proton-GE (this might not be necessary but it's my setup (3) Select the \"launch_fix2\" version (4) Install Gamescope (5) Add this to the Game Launcher: \"gamescope -w 640 -h 480 -W 1920 -H 1080 -f -- %command%\" so that it runs full screen.",
